---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Where It Comes From
usesChart: true
---
<h2 class="headline">Where the Money Comes From</h2>
<p class="byline">General Fund revenue, FY{{ budgets.latestRevenue.fiscalYear }}</p>

<p class="lede">
  Property taxation and state aid make up the overwhelming majority of Fitchburg's operating revenue.
  Below is the FY{{ budgets.latestRevenue.fiscalYear }} recap as filed with the Mayor's budget, grouped by major category.
</p>

<div class="chart-box">
  <canvas id="rev-pie" data-chart="doughnut" height="140"></canvas>
  <script type="application/json" id="rev-pie-data">{{ budgets.charts.revenueBreakdown | dump | safe }}</script>
</div>

<div class="chart-box">
  <canvas id="rev-trend" data-chart="line" height="90"></canvas>
  <script type="application/json" id="rev-trend-data">{{ budgets.charts.revenueTrend | dump | safe }}</script>
</div>

<h2 class="section-head">By Category</h2>
<p>What each category is, where it comes from, who controls it, and any tax rates or fees that apply.</p>
<div class="columns">
{% for cat in budgets.revenueCategories %}
  <div class="clipping">
    <strong><a href="/revenue/{{ cat.slug }}/">{{ cat.label }}</a></strong>
    — {{ cat.total | money }}{% if cat.shareOfRevenue %} ({{ (cat.shareOfRevenue * 100) | round(1) }}%){% endif %}
    {% if cat.whatItIs %}<p>{{ cat.whatItIs }}</p>{% endif %}
  </div>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<h2 class="section-head">Full Revenue Recap, FY{{ budgets.latestRevenue.fiscalYear }}</h2>
<table>
  <caption>Source: {{ budgets.latestRevenue.source.title }} — <a href="{{ budgets.latestRevenue.source.url }}">view PDF</a></caption>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Category</th><th>FY{{ budgets.latestRevenue.fiscalYear }}</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for item in budgets.latestRevenue.revenue.lineItems %}
    <tr {% if item.isSubtotal %}class="total-row"{% endif %}>
      <td>{{ item.label }}</td>
      <td>{{ item.values[budgets.latestRevenue.revenue.adoptedColumnIndex] | money }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<div class="notice">
  Line items not marked in bold are individual revenue sources; bold rows are subtotals for their section
  (Taxation, State Aid, Local Receipts, and so on). See <a href="/methodology/">Methodology</a> for how this
  is parsed directly from the budget PDF.
</div>
